From: TDVP Device Team <devices@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] config: include detected time headers independently

The obsolete TIME_WITH_SYS_TIME macro is no longer generated by modern
Autoconf. sys/time.h does not declare time or clock. Include each detected
header instead of selecting just sys/time.h when that macro is absent.

--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -1444,11 +1444,7 @@
 /* Get the correct time.h */
-#if TIME_WITH_SYS_TIME
+#if HAVE_SYS_TIME_H
 # include <sys/time.h>
+#endif
+#if HAVE_TIME_H
 # include <time.h>
-#else
-# if HAVE_SYS_TIME_H
-#  include <sys/time.h>
-# else
-#  include <time.h>
-# endif
 #endif
